bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Welcome to HUNT THE WUMPUS, a classic text adventure game.

Your mission: Navigate through dark caves to find and defeat the Wumpus.
But beware - the caves are filled with bottomless pits and deadly bats!

Navigate through the maze, avoid traps, and use your arrows wisely.

Commands: 'move [room]', 'shoot [room]', 'detect', 'help'

Good luck, brave hunter!"
